   "data": {
    "text": "CAMERA ANGLE\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 1, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Shot size\n   2 Angle height\n   3 Lens length\n   4 Dutch / level\n   5 Point of view\n   6 Angles per scene\n   7 Angles grouped\n   8 When the angle changes\n   9 Angle matched to the line\n  10 Angle matched to the action\n  11 Depth of field\n  12 Focus pull\n  13 Motion blur\n  14 Frame shape\n  15 Where the subject sits\n  16 suite: Coverage\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 1, CC 17 to 18\n   1 suite: Oner\n   2 pair: When shot size becomes close, volume drops"
   },
